1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,130
Deep in space, a dead star turned into a giant diamond.

2
00:00:04,830 --> 00:00:07,820
It weighs ten billion trillion trillion carats.

3
00:00:07,870 --> 00:00:12,540
When a medium star dies, its core collapses into carbon and oxygen.

4
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:17,230
Crushed by intense gravity, it slowly cools over billions of years.

5
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:22,280
Pause and guess: what mineral does compressed carbon form under extreme pressure?

6
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:26,930
It crystallizes completely, turning the entire star into one solid diamond.

7
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:30,660
Astronomers named this four-thousand-kilometer cosmic gemstone Lucy.

8
00:00:30,010 --> 00:00:34,290
In billions of years, our own Sun will suffer the exact same fate.

9
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:38,110
Meaning one day, where Earth used to sit...
